  "question": {
    "text": "The number of ways in which<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>5</mn></math> boys and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn></math>&nbsp;girls can be seated on a round table if a particular boy <math><msub><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> and a particular girl <math><msub><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></math> never sit adjacent to each other, is:",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "CoF0r",
      "text": "<math><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ti2ao",
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "id": "xFGih",
      "text": "<math><mn>6</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "sDUI7",
      "text": "<math><mn>5</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></math>",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Number of ways = Total&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo></math>&nbsp;when <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;sit together</p><p>Total ways in which&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>boys</mtext><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>girls</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>&nbsp;people can be arranged is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo></math></p><p>Now, when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#38;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;sit together the number of ways (other&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn></math>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>B</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>G</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></math>&nbsp;grouped together)&nbsp;is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo></math><br /><br />Hence, the required numer of ways is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>!</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>!</mo></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
